WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,300
Things that have been there for decades

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,260
Knocking on the child has saved me completely.

3
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:05,780
Dozens of people knocking each other out together can’t carry the flow and can’t flow.

4
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,700
How to fix it

5
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:12,420
Shut up if you don't want to die

6
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,420
I listen to water

7
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,800
Ten meters underground

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,190
There is an underground river that can be tapped

9
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:24,630
It can also submerge the poisonous gas, so it’s really tough

10
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,620
High groundwater pressure

11
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,180
Just open the rock formation

12
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,340
Let the underground river flow back

13
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:37,650
Is it saved? What about you? I will stay forever for the last time. This is an order to leave.
